{title: Raat Baaki Baat Baaki}
{artist: Asha Bhosle Bappi Lahiri Namak Halal}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#]Raat baki baat baki
[B]Hona hai jo [C#]ho jane do
[F#]Socho na dekho to dekho haan
[A]jane [B]ja mujhe [C#]pyaar se
[B]Kashti jawa dil ki [C#]tufa se takra gayi
[B]Manzil mohabbaat ki ab [C#]to karib aa gayi
[F#]Aa dekh le [B]hai kya maza [C#]dil har ke
[B]Aagaz yeh hai [C#]to anjaam hoga haseen
[B]Diwane parwane marne [C#]se darte nahi
[F#]Aa dilruba [B]khul ke zara [C#]mil yaar se
